  "Upstream markup and animation are adapted to the native frame clock; demo pages supply functional markup for paste-in primitives.",
  "OFL font files are installed from pinned local Fontsource packages; no font CDN is required.",
  "Missing media is replaced by explicitly authorized, locally authored sample artwork/video; it is not the original subject imagery.",
